  "cn": "第 7 集 · 下风向",
  "novel": "Marshall and Lily decided to buy an [[apartment|apartment]] in Dowisetrepla. The name sounded fancy until they learned it meant \"[[Downwind|downwind]] of the [[Sewage|sewage]] [[Treatment|treatment]] [[Plant|plant]].\"\n\nLily had [[concealed|conceal]] her [[debt|debt]] from Marshall. When the bank [[revealed|reveal]] her poor credit, the [[mortgage|mortgage]] was [[denied|deny]]. Marshall was [[devastated|devastate]]. \"How could you [[hide|hide]] this?\" he [[demanded|demand]].\n\nThe apartment had a terrible [[smell|smell]] that [[lingered|linger]] in every room. No [[candles|candle]] could [[mask|mask]] it. The [[location|location]] was [[downwind|downwind]] of the plant.\n\nBarney [[mocked|mock]] them [[relentlessly|relentlessly]]. In the end, Marshall forgave Lily. They kept the apartment. Some investments were not about money but about building a life — even with a permanent bad smell.",
